[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569727966","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101088#issuecomment-2569727966","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101088","id":2569727966,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZKu_e","user":{"login":"markdibarry","id":21325943,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzI1OTQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21325943?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry","html_url":"https://github.com/markdibarry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markdibarry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T19:41:48Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T20:11:39Z","body":"Not sure from the description but may be a duplicate as expected behavior. Some of the comments here explain more: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100168#issuecomment-2526357580","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569727966/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569800758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101088#issuecomment-2569800758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101088","id":2569800758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZLAw2","user":{"login":"Hendid","id":106771723,"node_id":"U_kgDOBl01Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106771723?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid","html_url":"https://github.com/Hendid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T20:52:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T20:52:32Z","body":"I looked through the two issues and I don't think the issue is the same. Also, when instead of using a richtextlabel and using a label, the behavior is the exact same but the value that's printed in get_text() shows up in the top left corner in a different position than the label text. So when incrementing the label.text value, I am left with the initial label text which is whatever it was declared and the new value that is in the top left.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569800758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569871610","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101088#issuecomment-2569871610","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101088","id":2569871610,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZLSD6","user":{"login":"Hendid","id":106771723,"node_id":"U_kgDOBl01Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106771723?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid","html_url":"https://github.com/Hendid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hendid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T22:00:55Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T22:00:55Z","body":"The only time I can visually update the richtextlabel.text or the correct label.text that isn't the duplicate is when I use \n\n`func _unhandled_input(event):\n\tif event is InputEventKey:\n\t\tif event.pressed and event.keycode == KEY_ESCAPE:\n\t\t\tmoney += 20`\n\nWhere \"KEY_A\" is any key and \"money\" is the setter variable. This only works in the same script that's attached to the richtextlabel and won't work if richtextlabel is referenced.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569871610/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727411047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101088#issuecomment-3727411047","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101088","id":3727411047,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eK8dn","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T06:29:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T06:29:46Z","body":"@Hendid Downloaded and tested your MRP - sorry to say a year later this is a GDScript mistake, not a bug.\n\n<img width=\"295\" height=\"126\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd497cbb-09ee-4203-bab4-98859bcabf50\" />\n\n`MoneyText.money += 20` is operating on MoneyText the Class, not MoneyText the Node being displayed on your screen. To modify the node, you need to retrieve a reference to it - for example `var MoneyTextNode = $\"/root/Control/ColorRect/MoneyText\"` is one of many ways to access a specific node.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727411047/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727977525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101088#issuecomment-3727977525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101088","id":3727977525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eNGw1","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T09:12:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T09:12:41Z","body":"Closing as not a bug","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727977525/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]